de Park Business Improvement Association BE ACCETPED, and Councillor S. Lehman BE APPOINTED to the Hyde Park BIA to fill the vacancy, for the term ending November 15, 2022.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [{"string": "Voting Record:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by S. Lewis", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by S. Turner", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the resignation of Councillor J. Morgan from the Hyde Park BIA, BE ACCEPTED.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["M. van Holst", "M. Salih", "J. Helmer", "M. Cassidy", "P. Squire", "J. Morgan", "A. Hopkins", "S. Turner", "S. Lewis", "S. Hillier", "E. Peloza", "P. Van Meerbergen", "S. Lehman,Mayor E. Holder"]}, {"vote": "Absent:", "voters": ["A. Kayabaga"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (14 to 0)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by S. Lewis", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by E. Peloza", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That nominations for an appointment to the Hyde Park BIA be opened.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["M. van Holst", "M. Salih", "J. Helmer", "M. Cassidy", "P. Squire", "J. Morgan", "A. Hopkins", "S. Turner", "S. Lewis", "S. Hillier", "E. Peloza", "P. Van Meerbergen", "S. Lehman,Mayor E. Holder"]}, {"vote": "Absent:", "voters": ["A. Kayabaga"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (14 to 0)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by S. Turner", "__class__": "Mover"}, "s